note-circle-equation-q22 circle \(c\) passes through \(a(6,11)\) and is centred at \(g(0,3)\).
(a)find the equation of \(c\).
(b)a moving point \(p\) satisfies \(ap=gp\), with locus \(\gamma\).
(i)find \(\gamma\);
(ii)describe its relation to \(ag\);
(iii)if \(\gamma\) cuts \(c\) at \(q,r\), find the perimeter of \(aqgr\). 圓 \(c\) 通過 \(a(6,11)\),圓心為 \(g(0,3)\)。
(a)求 \(c\) 的方程。
(b)動點 \(p\) 滿足 \(ap=gp\),軌跡為 \(\gamma\)。
(i)求 \(\gamma\) 方程;
(ii)描述 \(\gamma\) 與線段 \(ag\) 的關係;
(iii)若 \(\gamma\) 截 \(c\) 於 \(q,r\),求四邊形 \(aqgr\) 周界。 role引導練習 / guided practice · sourceyear 2014 · original q12 · conceptsl05-l14 · circle and locus · difficulty★★★★☆ role引導練習 / guided practice · sourceyear 2014 · original q12 · conceptsl05-l14 · circle and locus · difficulty★★★★☆ circle families and loci / 動圓與軌跡

note-circle-equation-q24 points \(a,b\) are \((-10,0),(30,0)\). circle \(c\) passes through them, and the y-coordinate of its centre \(g\) is \(-15\).
(a)find \(c\).
(b)line \(l\) passes through \(b,g\), and line \(\ell\) is parallel to \(l\). a moving point \(p\) is equidistant from \(l,\ell\), with locus \(\gamma\) passing through \(a\).
(i)describe the relation between \(\gamma\) and \(l\);
(ii)find \(\gamma\);
(iii)if \(\gamma\) cuts \(c\) again at \(h\), someone claims \(\angle gah<70^\circ\). do you agree? 點 \(a,b\) 的坐標為 \((-10,0),(30,0)\)。圓 \(c\) 通過 \(a,b\),圓心 \(g\) 的 \(y\) 坐標為 \(-15\)。
(a)求 \(c\) 的方程。
(b)直線 \(l\) 通過 \(b,g\),另一線 \(\ell\) 與 \(l\) 平行。動點 \(p\) 到 \(l,\ell\) 的垂直距離相等,軌跡為 \(\gamma\),且 \(\gamma\) 通過 \(a\)。
(i)描述 \(\gamma\) 與 \(l\) 的關係;
(ii)求 \(\gamma\) 方程;
(iii)若 \(\gamma\) 再截 \(c\) 於 \(h\),有人聲稱 \(\angle gah<70^\circ\)。你同意嗎?解釋。 role功課挑戰 / homework challenge · sourceyear 2020 · original q14 · conceptsl14-l15 · locus and claim audit · difficulty★★★★★ role功課挑戰 / homework challenge · sourceyear 2020 · original q14 · conceptsl14-l15 · locus and claim audit · difficulty★★★★★ circle families and loci / 動圓與軌跡
